      "settings": {
        "text_width": "regular",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<h2><strong>Dive into the Thrill of Drift Racing with Our Ready-to-Run Collection</strong></h2><p>Our<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/drift-cars-rtr\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Ready-to-Run collection</span></a> is designed to get you into the exciting world of drift racing immediately. With RC cars that are ready to run straight out of the box, you can immerse yourself in the action without the need for assembly. We offer a variety of cars to suit your preference, whether you're looking for 2wd or Rwd, or specific body styles like the classic Nissan Skyline or Silvia.</p><h3><strong>Discover the Yokomo Drift Car Range</strong></h3><p><a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/yokomo-australia\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Yokomo</span></a> has been a leading name in the RC drift car industry, renowned for its superior quality and performance. We are proud to offer a range of Yokomo models including the<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/yokomo-yd-2zx-1-10-ep-rwd-r-c-drift-car-red-version\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Yokomo YD-2ZX</span></a>,<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/yokomo-super-drift-sd1-0-rwd-drift-car-assembly-kit\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Super Drift SD1.0</span></a>, and<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/yokomo-rookie-drift-rd1-0-rwd-draft-car-assembly-kit-with-yg-302-gyro\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Rookie Drift RD1.0</span></a>.</p><h2><strong>Customize Your Experience with Our Range of Parts and Accessories</strong></h2><p>Whether you're looking to customize your car's body, upgrade your tires, or enhance your steering with a new servo, we have a vast selection of parts and accessories to help you create the ultimate RC drift car. Visit our collections of<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/1-10-on-road-body\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bodies</span></a>,<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/drift-tyres\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">drift tyres</span></a>, and<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/servos\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">servos</span></a> to find the perfect fit for your vehicle.</p><h3><strong>Start Your RC Journey with Hearns Hobbies Today</strong></h3><p>Dive into the fast-paced world of RC drift racing with Hearns Hobbies. Our collection of RC drift cars and accessories offer everything you need to start your racing journey. Browse our<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/drift-cars-rtr\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">RTR Drift Car collection</span></a> and start your RC journey with us today.</p>",
