        "template--16130083520673__e16ca451-f323-4802-a147-abb243d7232e-question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is a Ready-to-Run (RTR) RC Drift Car?",
            "answer": "<p>A Ready-to-Run (RTR) RC drift car is a model that is ready to run right out of the box. These cars come pre-assembled, making it easy for you to start your RC drift racing journey. They are perfect for both beginners and seasoned enthusiasts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16130083520673__e16ca451-f323-4802-a147-abb243d7232e-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between 2WD and RWD drift cars?",
            "answer": "<p>Two-wheel drive (2WD) and rear-wheel drive (RWD) refer to the wheels that the engine powers. In a 2WD drift car, the power can go to either the front or the rear wheels, while in a RWD car, the power goes only to the rear wheels. RWD drift cars are more common in the RC drift scene as they closely mimic the dynamics of real drift cars.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16130083520673__e16ca451-f323-4802-a147-abb243d7232e-question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why choose a Yokomo Drift Car?",
            "answer": "<p>Yokomo has a reputation for high-quality and high-performance RC drift cars. Their models, such as the<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/yokomo-yd-2zx-1-10-ep-rwd-r-c-drift-car-red-version\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Yokomo YD-2ZX</span></a>,<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/yokomo-super-drift-sd1-0-rwd-drift-car-assembly-kit\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Super Drift SD1.0</span></a>, and<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/yokomo-rookie-drift-rd1-0-rwd-draft-car-assembly-kit-with-yg-302-gyro\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Rookie Drift RD1.0</span></a> are renowned for their superior handling and control, making them excellent choices for both beginners and experienced drift racers.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16130083520673__e16ca451-f323-4802-a147-abb243d7232e-question-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I customize my RC Drift Car?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, at Hearns Hobbies, we offer a wide range of parts and accessories to help you customize your RC drift car. From different<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/1-10-on-road-body\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">body styles</span></a> and<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/drift-tyres\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">drift tyres</span></a> to<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/servos\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">servos</span></a> for enhanced steering control, we have everything you need to make your RC drift car truly unique.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16130083520673__e16ca451-f323-4802-a147-abb243d7232e-question-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I get started with RC drift racing?",
            "answer": "<p>Getting started with RC drift racing is easy with Hearns Hobbies. We recommend starting with one of our<a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/drift-cars-rtr\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">RTR Drift Cars</span></a>, which come pre-assembled and ready to run right out of the box. As you gain more experience and confidence, you can start customizing your car with different parts and accessories to suit your driving style.</p>"
          }
        }
